<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1867928484"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1688512535"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="不埒な喝采"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="可不 / ポリスピカデリー"/><amll:meta key="album" value="KAF+YOU KAFU COMPILATION ALBUM"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:24.785"><div begin="00:04.507" end="02:20.030"><p begin="00:04.507" end="00:09.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">炎を見たいなら蟠りを灰にして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若渴望目睹火焰需消除思想阻碍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho no o wo mi ta i na ra wa da ka ma ri wo ha i ni shi te</span></p><p begin="00:10.391" end="00:11.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">虚しくなるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因会愈发空虚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu na shi ku na ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:12.917" end="00:15.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">余白に入り浸らないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">切忌让自己沉浸于空白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ha ku ni i ri hi ta ra na i de</span></p><p begin="00:16.613" end="00:18.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">微睡みの最中で滅裂<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在朦胧浅眠之中瓦解</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma do ro mi no na ka de ba ra ba ra</span></p><p begin="00:19.758" end="00:21.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">繋ぎ合わせるの端から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从心绪相牵的那一刻起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na gi a wa se ru no ha na ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:22.752" end="00:24.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">愛の形は様々<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱有多种形态</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i no ka ta chi ha sa ma za ma</span></p><p begin="00:25.780" end="00:27.102" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">繰り返す甘辛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终是甜咸尽尝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e su a ma ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:27.905" end="00:30.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">紛い物だった不埒な喝采<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实不过虚妄 不羁的喝彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ga i mo no da 't ta fu ra chi na ka 's sa i</span></p><p begin="00:31.016" end="00:32.722" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">淀み溶かし込んでゆけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉淀后慢慢地融于其中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo do mi to ka shi ko n de yu ke</span></p><p begin="00:33.927" end="00:36.235" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">今更だろって皮肉なものさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">本就为时已晚 一切尽显讽刺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma sa ra da ro 't te hi ni ku na mo no sa</span></p><p begin="00:36.971" end="00:38.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">この場所にはもういない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这个地方早就不复存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ba sho ni ha mo u i na i</span></p><p begin="00:39.865" end="00:41.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">いちゃいけない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不允许存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i cha i ke na i</span></p><p begin="00:41.358" end="00:42.307" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">いけない いけない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不允许 不允许</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ke na i i ke na i</span></p><p begin="00:42.909" end="00:43.629" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">いけない deny<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不允许 拒绝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ke na i deny</span></p><p begin="00:47.108" end="00:51.575" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">弱さ見せるのは信頼の証だね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">示弱其实是信赖的证明吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo wa sa mi se ru no ha shi n ra i no a ka shi da ne</span></p><p begin="00:52.997" end="00:55.004" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">綻び始めが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始露出破绽只是因为</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ko ro bi ha ji me ga ta ma ra na ku te</span></p><p begin="00:55.489" end="00:58.249" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">堪らなくてしょうがないんだ</p><p begin="00:59.320" end="01:00.975" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">食み出た嫉み滴々<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嫉妒涌现滴滴答答</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha mi de ta so ne mi ta ra ta ra</span></p><p begin="01:02.196" end="01:04.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">白々しさも白地<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">佯装不知也是种直率</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ra ji ra shi sa mo a ka ra sa ma</span></p><p begin="01:05.274" end="01:07.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">続きがあるんだ未だ未だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">故事依然在继续 还未终结</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu du ki ga a ru n da ma da ma da</span></p><p begin="01:08.051" end="01:09.573" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">面白いのはこっから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">精彩的一幕即刻上演</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo shi ro i no ha ko 'k ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:10.259" end="01:12.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">紛い物だった不埒な喝采<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实不过虚妄 不羁的喝彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ga i mo no da 't ta fu ra chi na ka 's sa i</span></p><p begin="01:13.387" end="01:15.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">早く深く消えてゆけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽快消失于最深之处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ya ku fu ka ku ki e te yu ke</span></p><p begin="01:16.514" end="01:18.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">気が済むまで頬張ればいいさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在心满意足之前只需大快朵颐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ga su mu ma de ho o ba re ba i i sa</span></p><p begin="01:19.576" end="01:21.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">留まるのも悪くない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">停驻于此倒也不坏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ma ru no mo wa ru ku na i</span></p><p begin="01:22.336" end="01:23.239" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">悪くない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倒也不坏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ru ku na i</span></p><p begin="01:23.741" end="01:24.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">無くはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非如此吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku ha na i</span></p><p begin="01:25.314" end="01:26.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">無くはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非如此吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku ha na i</span></p><p begin="01:29.495" end="01:31.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">今そこにあるカード選ぶだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需选择存在于那里的命运卡牌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma so ko ni a ru ka a do e ra bu da ke</span></p><p begin="01:32.723" end="01:34.513" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">引き換えに生きて相殺<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以此换取生命 功过相抵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ki ka e ni i ki te so u sa i</span></p><p begin="01:35.768" end="01:37.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">どうしたって陽は昇るし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝阳不论如何都会冉冉升起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u shi ta 't te hi ha no bo ru shi</span></p><p begin="01:38.728" end="01:40.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">単なる弾みで繋がってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需要趁势与彼此缘分相牵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta n na ru ha zu mi de tsu na ga 't te ru</span></p><p begin="01:43.095" end="01:45.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">紛い物だった不埒な喝采<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实不过虚妄 不羁的喝彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ga i mo no da 't ta fu ra chi na ka 's sa i</span></p><p begin="01:46.189" end="01:48.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">淀み溶かし込んでゆけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉淀后慢慢地融于其中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo do mi to ka shi ko n de yu ke</span></p><p begin="01:49.100" end="01:51.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">今更だろって皮肉なものさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">本就为时已晚 一切尽显讽刺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma sa ra da ro 't te hi ni ku na mo no sa</span></p><p begin="01:52.312" end="01:54.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">この場所にはもういない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这个地方早就不复存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ba sho ni ha mo u i na i</span></p><p begin="01:55.205" end="01:56.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">いちゃいけない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不允许存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i cha i ke na i</span></p><p begin="01:56.611" end="01:57.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">いけない いけない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不允许 不允许</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ke na i i ke na i</span></p><p begin="01:58.149" end="01:58.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">いけない deny<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不允许 拒绝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ke na i deny</span></p><p begin="02:01.211" end="02:02.097" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">いちゃいけない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不允许存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i cha i ke na i</span></p><p begin="02:02.616" end="02:03.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">いけない...<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不允许 不允许</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ke na i i ke na i</span></p><p begin="02:08.454" end="02:13.037" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">炎を見たいなら蟠りを灰にして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若渴望目睹火焰需消除思想阻碍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho no o wo mi ta i na ra wa da ka ma ri wo ha i ni shi te</span></p><p begin="02:14.292" end="02:20.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">やがては痛みと共に失ってしまうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终将伴随那份痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ga te ha i ta mi to to mo ni</span></p></div></body></tt>